---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="Affiliate disclosure for LuneAster Travel — how we earn commissions and why it doesn't affect our recommendations."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <span class="hero-tag">☽ Transparency</span>
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated: August 6, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="disclosure-box">
        <p class="ftc-statement">
          <strong>As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong>
          This site also participates in other affiliate programs with Klook, Travelpayouts,
          and Booking.com (via Awin). I may earn a commission when you click links and make
          qualifying purchases — at no additional cost to you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>What Are Affiliate Links?</h2>
      <p>
        Affiliate links are special URLs that track referrals. When you click an affiliate link
        on this site and make a purchase on the partner's website (Amazon, Klook, Booking.com, etc.),
        the partner pays us a small commission. You pay the same price whether or not you use our link.
      </p>

      <h2>Which Affiliate Programs Do We Use?</h2>
      <ul class="program-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Amazon Associates</strong> — For travel gear recommendations (adapters, chargers,
          packing accessories, guidebooks). Amazon's tracking cookie lasts 24 hours.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Klook Affiliate</strong> — For Japan activity tickets, JR Pass, and pocket WiFi
          rentals. Klook's tracking cookie lasts 30 days.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Travelpayouts / Aviasales</strong> — For flight price comparison and booking.
          Cookie duration varies by airline.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Booking.com (via Awin)</strong> — For hotel and accommodation reservations.
          Cookie lasts for the duration of the booking session.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We Choose What to Recommend</h2>
      <p>
        Affiliate commissions never influence our recommendations. We only link to products
        and services that:
      </p>
      <ul class="criteria-list">
        <li>We have personally used during our Japan trips, or</li>
        <li>We have thoroughly researched and believe will genuinely help travelers, or</li>
        <li>Are the best-value option in their category</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        If a product is bad, we won't recommend it — even if the commission is high.
        Our reputation and your trust are worth more than any single commission payment.
      </p>

      <h2>How to Identify Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>
        Affiliate links on this site typically contain tracking parameters such as
        <code>?tag=</code> (Amazon), <code>?aid=</code> (Klook), <code>?marker=</code> (Travelpayouts),
        or <code>?aid=</code> (Booking.com/Awin). You can see these in your browser's address bar
        after clicking.
      </p>
      <p>
        Blog articles may also contain inline links within the text. Unless otherwise stated,
        any link to a product or booking page should be considered an affiliate link.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Support Matters</h2>
      <p>
        When you use our affiliate links, you support LuneAster Travel at no extra cost.
        This revenue helps us:
      </p>
      <ul class="criteria-list">
        <li>Maintain this website and keep articles free to read</li>
        <li>Create more detailed travel guides and budget breakdowns</li>
        <li>Travel to new destinations to research future content</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Thank you for your support. If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships,
        feel free to reach out at <a href="mailto:luneaster17@gmail.com">luneaster17@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>FTC Compliance</h2>
      <p>
        This disclosure complies with the U.S. Federal Trade Commission (FTC) guidelines on
        the use of endorsements and testimonials in advertising (16 CFR Part 255).
        Our affiliate relationships are disclosed clearly and conspicuously on every page
        containing affiliate links, and in the site footer.
      </p>

      <p>
        See also: <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 5rem 0 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-tag {
    display: block;
    color: var(--c-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
  }

  .container-narrow {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .disclosure-box {
    background: var(--c-surface);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--c-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .ftc-statement {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--c-text);
    margin: 0;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  p a, li a {
    color: var(--c-accent-light);
  }

  code {
    background: var(--c-surface);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--c-accent);
  }

  .program-list,
  .criteria-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .program-list li,
  .criteria-list li {
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .program-list li strong {
    color: var(--c-text);
  }
</style>
